# QR nick, Quét bằng camera (tauri-plugin-barcode-scanner, Google ML Kit): ML Kit finds its parts by reflection (the
# ComponentRegistrar of the manifest, then by class). Optimised by R8 the first frame crashed the app (24/11, 2.2.21:
# NullPointerException in mlkit_vision_common zzkx.<init> from InputImage.fromMediaImage). Kept as they are.
-keep class com.google.mlkit.** { *; }
-keep class com.google.android.gms.internal.mlkit_** { *; }
-keep class com.google.firebase.components.** { *; }
